<p style="Normal" xid="2521" props="text-align:center; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="1320" props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; dom-dir:ltr; lang:en-US; font-weight:bold; text-position:normal; text-align:center; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:20pt">Toolbox, assembler, disassembler, BASIC compiler and decompiler for</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:20pt"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="1352" props="text-align:center; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:20pt"></c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:20pt">the SHARP PC-1500/A and TRS80 PC-2</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="1349" props="text-align:center; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:22pt"></c><c></c></p>
