<p style="Normal" xid="1336" props="text-align:center; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal">Copyright 1992 - </c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c><c props="font-weight:bold">2021 - Christophe Gottheimer</c><pbr/></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="1298" props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; dom-dir:ltr; lang:en-US; font-weight:normal; text-position:normal; text-align:justify; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none">The </c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-weight:bold">lhTools</c> are a tool box for assembling, disassembling, build BASIC basic binaries and <c props="font-style:italic">“decompiling”</c> the programs BASIC or ML of the SHARP PC-1500/A and TANDY PC-2.</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="2" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="3" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-size:12pt">The </c><c props="font-size:12pt"></c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt">lhTools</c><c props="font-size:12pt"> are </c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:12pt">copyright 1992-2021 Christophe Gottheimer</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:11pt"> &lt;</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-family:Courier 10 Pitch; font-size:11pt">cgh750215@gmail.com</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:11pt">&gt;</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="4" props="text-align:justify; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="1677" props="text-align:justify; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Liberation Serif; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">This code is distributed under the terms of the </c><c props="font-family:Liberation Serif; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c><c props="font-family:Liberation Serif; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">GNU Public License (GPL) version 2</c><c props="font-family:Liberation Serif; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="1678" props="text-align:justify; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Liberation Serif; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="5" props="text-align:justify; dom-dir:ltr">This version is still in pre-alpha release. It is not fully mature and bugs are present.<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="1674" props="text-align:justify; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
